          deckDescription: 'One standard 48-card Spanish deck (twelve ranks in four suits: swords, batons, cups, coins). The Aluette pack has distinctive traditional artwork and a fixed hierarchy; no jokers. Used in western France.',
          suitDescription: 'Four Spanish suits (swords, batons, cups, coins). Suits do not determine card strength; the fixed Aluette ranking (with monsieur and madame as top cards) applies regardless of suit.',
